// GitHubOIDCIdentityMapping is the Schema for the GitHubOIDCIdentityMappings API. Provides a GitHub Actions OIDC identity mapping (called a persona mapping in the Datadog API) for Datadog workload identity federation. The mapping allows a GitHub Actions workload whose OIDC token matches the claim_matchers patterns to authenticate as the Datadog user or service account identified by account_identifier. The identity creating the mapping must have every permission assigned to the target identity. Creating the initial mapping requires API and application credentials with the Workload Identity Federation write permission; a provider already using federation cannot bootstrap its own mapping. Mappings cannot be updated; changing any attribute replaces the mapping. This resource uses a public beta API and is subject to change.
// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name="SYNCED",type="string",JSONPath=".status.conditions[?(@.type=='Synced')].status"
